:five: How would you structure branching and pull-request strategies for a team deploying multiple releases per week?
:six: How would you troubleshoot a pipeline that was working yesterday but suddenly starts failing without any code changes?
:seven: An application running in containers becomes unhealthy immediately after deployment. How would you determine whether the problem is with the image, configuration, networking, or orchestration platform?
