:one::two: An Infrastructure-as-Code deployment partially succeeds and then fails. Some resources have already been created. How would you safely recover without causing infrastructure drift?
:one::three: Two production deployments are triggered simultaneously by different teams. How would you design the pipeline to prevent race conditions and ensure the correct version reaches production?
:one::four: A pipeline suddenly takes 40 minutes instead of 5 minutes. There are no obvious application-code changes. How would you identify the bottleneck and optimize the pipeline?
:one::five: A container works perfectly in development but repeatedly crashes after production deployment. How would you systematically isolate image, environment-variable, configuration, networking, resource, and dependency issues?
